  "prefLabel": "Pda 501.02 Scope",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pda 501.02 Scope. Pda 500 shall apply to all mooring permits issued. Any person who sets, seeks to set, or uses a mooring in state tidal waters shall comply with Pda 500.\n\nSource. #7940, eff 8-23-03; ss by #9975, eff 8-20-11; ss by #12958, eff 12-24-19",
